<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">4 </span>Experiment</h2>

<div id="S4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we evaluate the performance of Auto-Stega in terms of efficiency, imperceptibility, and security and human evaluation. The details of the experimental setup and result analysis are presented in the following subsections. Appendix <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Evolution of Steganographic Strategies ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Auto-Stega: An Agent-Driven System for Lifelong Strategy Evolution in LLM-Based Text Steganography" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a> provides representative high scoring strategy entries, and Appendix <a href="#A1.SS3" title="A.3 Full prompts for the Steganography LLM and Summarizer LLM ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Auto-Stega: An Agent-Driven System for Lifelong Strategy Evolution in LLM-Based Text Steganography" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> presents complete prompt templates for the steganographic LLM and the summarizer LLM.</p>
</div>
