<span id="A1.T6.2.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Embed via consistent transitions plus rich, domain-adapted elaborations across multiple domains; introduce paragraph-level redundancy to improve error tolerance without generic phrasing.</span>
</span></td>
